    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibition of refusal to comply with direction.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) refuses or fails to comply with a direction given under subsection 40VE(1) or 40VG(2);";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "An AFP appointee commits an offence if the AFP appointee: (a) refuses or fails to comply with a direction given under subsection 40VE(1) or 40VG(2);";
