    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The Minister administering the Crimes (Superannuation Benefits) Act 1989 is of the opinion that the offence is a corruption offence.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "Therefore, during this time, the DPP shall authorise the appropriate court to apply for a superannuation order in respect of the person.";
